          <span class="t-logo">L<span class="a">a</span>T<span class="e">e</span>X</span> CV class, with extended details.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/cvsty">CVsty</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Yet another style for easy CV pagination.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/dfg-crc">Dfg-crc</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Create DFG Collaborative Research Centre proposals and CVs.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/ecv">ECV</a>
        </div>
