       for KOMA-classes and thus compatible with Bib<span class="t-logo">L<span class="a">a</span>T<span class="e">e</span>X</span>.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/limecv">Limecv</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          A (Xe/Lua)<span class="t-logo">L<span class="a">a</span>T<span class="e">e</span>X</span> document class for curriculum vitæ.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/moderncv">Moderncv</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          A modern curriculum vitae class.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/moderntimeline">Moderntimeline</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Timelines for use with moderncv.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/mycv">Mycv</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          A list-driven CV class, allowing <span class="t-logo">Ti<span class="k">k</span>Z</span> decorations.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/nihbiosketch">Nihbiosketch</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          A class for NIH biosketches based on the 2015 updated format.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/pas-cv">Pas-cv</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Flexible typesetting of Curricula Vitae.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/pats-resume">Pats-resume</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          A <span class="t-logo">L<span class="a">a</span>T<span class="e">e</span>X</span> template for your resume.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/readablecv">ReadableCV</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          A highly readable and good looking CV and letter class.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/res">Res</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          A resumé class.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/resumecls">Resumecls</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Typeset a resume both in English and Chinese.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/resumemac">Resumemac</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Plain <span class="t-logo">T<span class="e">e</span>X</span> macros for resumés.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/simplecv">Simplecv</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          A simple class for writing curricula vitae.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/simple-resume-cv">Simple-resume-cv</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Template for a simple resume or curriculum vitae (CV), in <span class="t-logo">X<span class="E">e</span>L<span class="a">a</span>T<span class="e">e</span>X</span>.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/tidyres">Tidyres</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Create formal resumes easily.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/translation-ecv-de">Translation-ecv-de</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Ecv documentation, in German.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/translation-europecv-de">Translation-europecv-de</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          German version of europecv.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/tucv">Tucv</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Support for typesetting a CV or résumeé.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/vita">Vita</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
          Configurable class for curricula vitarum.
        </div>
     
        <div class="dt">
          <a href="/pkg/vita209">Vita209</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dd">
